### Create a new User
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ZITADEL_JWT_TOKEN

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Get User Profile
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/users/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ZITADEL_JWT_TOKEN